The discussion above coupled with the annual Nethack tournament at 
devnull prompted me to ask this question. I played without tiles for 
years until they became available with the download of Nethack, at which 
point I switched to the graphical interface.

The major drawback for me is that it makes it difficult (if not 
impossible) to participate in devnull's tournament or on public servers. 
  The other drawback (which isn't a big deal to me) is that I can't post 
dumps of ascensions when they happen. But the first problem is the most 
pressing to me.

How hard would it be to make it so that Nethack could be played in 
tournaments and on public servers using tiles? Personally I think it's 
overdue.

